===Etymology===
German and Jewish surname, borrowed from {{bor|en|de|Nadel|t=needle}}.

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|s}}

# {{surname|en|from=German}}.

====Statistics====
* According to the 2010 United States Census, ''Nadel'' is the 18317<sup>th</sup> most common surname in the United States, belonging to 1513 individuals. ''Nadel'' is most common among White (90.61%) individuals.

